<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $700,000 repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $700,000 repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said it placed $700,000 in overnight repurchase agreements at 9.0 percent Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0650)</p>
